msgid "The legal details German and EU shops must show: delivery times, unit prices, deposits, manufacturers, allergens and nutrients. Bank details are never included."
msgstr ""

#: src/Features/WooCommerceTools/Descriptors/GermanizedCopy.php:22
msgid "See delivery times, units, price labels, deposit types, manufacturers, allergens and nutrients, and these details on any product, including drafts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Features/WooCommerceTools/Descriptors/GermanizedCopy.php:26
msgid "Manage those lists, and set these details on any product, without being able to change its price, status or tax status. A deposit set on a product is added to what customers pay at checkout, and getting legal details wrong has legal consequences, so changes to products and deposits and every deletion need explicit confirmation."
msgstr ""

